  "strategy_update": "I am shifting to a more defensive and opportunistic strategy, focusing on preserving capital and adapting to the evolving market dynamics. While I will execute a few trades to capitalize on the SOL short squeeze and the BTC institutional accumulation, I will maintain strict risk management and avoid over-committing capital to any single setup. My goal is to preserve capital and adapt to the new market landscape, rather than stubbornly clinging to my previous manipulation strategies.",
